[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240410763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145#issuecomment-3240410763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110145","id":3240410763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BJL6L","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T21:05:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T21:05:04Z","body":"This should be done carefully. What if you remove the node from the scene tree, change some settings, and then add it back?\r\n\r\nProbably it should be [`NOTIFICATION_POST_ENTER_TREE`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-constant-notification-post-enter-tree).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240410763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240615231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145#issuecomment-3240615231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110145","id":3240615231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BJ90_","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T01:26:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T01:26:51Z","body":"@rburing Considering that Skeleton2D's modification stack is also done within the NOTIFICATION_POST_ENTER_TREE case, that might be reasonable. Then, `_process_modification_with_delta()` will fire after the child's Modifiers are ready and before the Skeleton is ready, but is this sufficient to resolve your issue @plaught-armor ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240615231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242444748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145#issuecomment-3242444748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110145","id":3242444748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BQ8fM","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T13:45:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T13:45:21Z","body":"This change looked scary to me, so I spent a couple hours going through manual tests and code inspection. At this point, I'm pretty happy with it aside from a single bug that occurs in deprecated code.\r\n\r\nThe problem is with using the deprecated setup where `PhysicalBone3D` is a child of a `Skeleton3D` instead of a child of `PhysicalBone3DSimulator`. In this case, it expects that the skeleton has already called `setup_simulator` in `ENTER_TREE` and tries to access the `simulator` that would've been configured previously but no longer is. This results in the simulation never getting applied to the bones.\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, it seems correct that the simulator setup happened in `ENTER_TREE` and not `POST_ENTER_TREE`. It seems fine to leave that one call in `ENTER_TREE` and move everything else to `POST_ENTER_TREE`, as the simulator setup doesn't actually interact with bones at all.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242444748/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242900179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145#issuecomment-3242900179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110145","id":3242900179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BSrrT","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T16:40:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T16:40:39Z","body":"@precup Nice catch for the finding `PhysicalBone3DSimulator` problem! I have confirmed that the PhysicalBone3DSimulator does not function with the old configuration.\r\n\r\nFor now, I left the two functions not directly related to the modifiers `_process_changed()` and `setup_simulator()` as is in `ENTER_TREE` and set the dirty flag using `POST_ENTER_TREE`. The issue with PhysicalBone3DSimulator should now be resolved.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3242900179/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3258412273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145#issuecomment-3258412273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110145","id":3258412273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CN2zx","user":{"login":"plaught-armor","id":189848842,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1DdCg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189848842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor","html_url":"https://github.com/plaught-armor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-05T13:46:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-05T13:46:00Z","body":"It fixes my immediate problem","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3258412273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perf